<title>USA: TFC Enterprises names new CFO.</title>
<headline>TFC Enterprises names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TFC Enterprises Inc said on Wednesday it named David Karsten chief financial officer and controller.  </p>
<p>Karsten joined the company on November 4, having worked for for 11 years with an insurance company and five years with a large public accounting firm.</p>
<p>The CFO and controller posts were previously held by two TFC employees, but were being merged into one job, TFC said.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment further.</p>
